  "limits": [
    "This is a geometric explanation rig, not measured actuator motion, force calibration or proof of perceptual performance.",
    "A/B/C identify CAD positions. Finger and firmware channel assignments are intentionally null until separately confirmed.",
    "The negative-Z source joint orientation is canonicalized to positive-Z pad input; actual servo-command signs are not calibrated by this export.",
    "Nominal transmission ratio -1 is geometry-derived. No motionLink exists, and contact, backlash, load and collision limits were not simulated or measured.",
    "Original placement differences are retained: the paired-side fin Y coordinates do not exactly match the corresponding servo shaft Y coordinates.",
    "FSR rigid attachment is unresolved. These nodes are retained at the exported rest pose by default; this is a presentation fallback, not a statement that the actual sensors are fixed to the frame.",
    "There are no vibration transducer bodies in this CAD. Three FSR400 bodies identify sensor geometry, not verified channel wiring or force measurements.",
    "The representative contact anchors come from actual planar faces, but are not measured finger-contact points.",
    "No original VRSJ2026 CAD assets were overwritten. Hidden WHC bodies were not exported."
